{"strongs": "H4285", "word": "מַחְשַׁךְ", "translit": "mach.shakh", "root": "חרש", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "dark place", "definition": "מַחְשַׁךְ noun masculine dark place (poetry) — absolute ׳ מ Isa 29:15 ; Isa 42:16 מַחְשָׁ֑ךְ Ps 88:19 plural מַחֲשַׁכִּים Ps 88:7 ; Ps 143:3 = Lam 3:6 construct מַחֲשַׁכֵּי Ps 74:20 — dark place: \\ \\ a. = hiding-place אֿרץ ׳ מח Ps 74:20 . \\ \\ b. dark region , in which men may lose their way Isa 42:16 . \\ \\ c. = grave , or שׁאול Ps 88:19 (see Che ); of dark place of God's wrath (like She' ô l) Ps 88:7 compare Ps 143:3 = Lam 3:6 . \\ \\ d. = secret place, secrecy (of plots) Isa 29:15 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3222')\">BDB3222</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4285')\">H4285</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3221')\">BDB3221</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3223')\">BDB3223</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַחְשַׁךְ</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>dark place</highlightword> (poetry) — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 29:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,15)\">Isa 29:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 42:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,16)\">Isa 42:16</ref> <bdbheb>מַחְשָׁ֑ךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 88:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"88\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"88\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,88,19)\">Ps 88:19</ref> plural <bdbheb>מַחֲשַׁכִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 88:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"88\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"88\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,88,7)\">Ps 88:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 143:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"143\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"143\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,143,3)\">Ps 143:3</ref> = <ref ref=\"Lam 3:6\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,6)\">Lam 3:6</ref> construct <bdbheb>מַחֲשַׁכֵּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 74:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"20\" cEn